<template><AdminLayout><section><p class="eyebrow">NWP LATEST RUN</p><h1>未来气象最新起报</h1><p class="intro">8 卡服务器 · 最新起报 {{ nwp?.issued_at_cn || '加载中' }} · 时间统一转换为 UTC+8</p><div class="run-card"><span>源文件</span><b>{{ nwp?.source_file || '加载中' }}</b><small>仅同步最新起报；按场站经纬度最近网格裁剪，保留未来时间轴</small></div><div class="nwp-grid"><div v-for="station in nwp?.stations || []" :key="station.station_id" class="nwp-card"><strong>{{ station.station_id }}</strong><span>经度 {{ station.longitude.toFixed(3) }} · 纬度 {{ station.latitude.toFixed(3) }}</span><div class="vars"><div v-for="(value,key) in station.variables" :key="key"><small>{{ key }}</small><b>{{ Number(value).toFixed(2) }}</b></div></div><div class="forecast-strip"><div class="forecast-title">未来时间轴（UTC+8）</div><div v-for="item in (station.forecast || []).slice(0,16)" :key="item.valid_time_utc" class="forecast-row"><span>{{ formatCn(item.valid_time_utc) }}</span><b>T2m {{ item.variables.t2m == null ? '—' : Number(item.variables.t2m).toFixed(1) }} · U10 {{ item.variables.u10 == null ? '—' : Number(item.variables.u10).toFixed(1) }} · V10 {{ item.variables.v10 == null ? '—' : Number(item.variables.v10).toFixed(1) }}</b></div></div></div></div></section></AdminLayout></template>
